Lint check concepts
-------------------

The check categories implemented in scripts/diagram_*.rb (the cf:diagram
SVG linter) were informed by two MIT-licensed projects:

  diagram-design
  Copyright (c) 2025 Cathryn Lavery
  MIT License, https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design

  svg-diagram
  Copyright (c) 2026 bybit-exchange
  MIT License, https://github.com/bybit-exchange/svg-diagram

Only the idea of which properties to check was taken. No source code,
prose, palette, fonts, CSS, icons, or fixtures were copied from either
project. The implementation is an independent Ruby rewrite written from
cf:diagram's own grammar.

